                                "sense_id": "cd6c1cc0-6a68-32ae-8d0c-a098d7cd75f4",
                                "text": "“My Son,” saith he, “honour God & the King ; but I say, honour God and the bishop as high-priest, bearing the image of God according to his ruling, and of Christ, according to his priesting, and after him honour the king.”"
